OL,3,GNEWSABurrows to announce Nesbitt's
OL,4,Areplacement as health minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new health minister for Northern
OL,7,FIreland is expected to be announced
OL,8,Flater following the resignation of
OL,9,FUlster Unionist Mike Nesbitt from the
OL,10,Fpost.
OL,12,FNesbitt announced he was stepping down
OL,13,Fon Tuesday night amid a row with his
OL,14,Fparty leader Jon Burrows.
OL,16,FIt followed a clash over withdrawing
OL,17,Femergency general surgery services from
OL,18,FCauseway Hospital, where Nesbitt said
OL,19,Fthe party leader had "introduced a
OL,20,Fsecond red line".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
