OL,3,GNEWSABurrows to announce Nesbitt's
OL,4,Areplacement as health minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn emergency meeting of Stormont's
OL,7,Fhealth committee is also due to take
OL,8,Fplace on Thursday to discuss the fall
OL,9,Fout from Nesbitt's resignation.
